import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="SMAG privacy policy and data practices.">
  <section class="wrap listing-page prose"><p class="section-kicker">YOUR PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy policy<span>.</span></h1><p>This starter policy is a publication template, not a final legal notice. Before launch, update it to describe the actual hosting provider, analytics, advertising, newsletter, cookies and contact tools used by SMAG.</p><h2>Information collected</h2><p>SMAG should collect only information necessary to operate reader-facing services. If analytics, forms or subscriptions are enabled, disclose the data collected, purpose, retention period and relevant providers here.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>External image, font, analytics and advertising providers may receive technical information when a page loads. List the services actually enabled before publication.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact the publication using its verified contact address.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>